      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_035_01_b:step-4:text",
        "step_id": 4,
        "step_index": 3,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_035_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ですが、その創意工夫は素敵だと思います。\n今回の動画にも、その経験を活かしましょう！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "presence": "not-applicable",
        "reason": "non-idol-dialogue",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 5
      },
      "diagnostics": [],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_035_01_b:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_035_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ああ。だが少し、アプローチを\n変えた方がいいのかもしれない。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "硲 道夫"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "035mco"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "035mco",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 6
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_035_01_b:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_035_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "実際の授業と授業の動画とでは、違うことも\n多いだろう。それに、今の私はアイドルだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "硲 道夫"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "035mco"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "035mco",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 7
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_035_01_b:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_035_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そうですね。アイドルとしての\n新しいアプローチがあるはずです。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "presence": "not-applicable",
        "reason": "non-idol-dialogue",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 8
      },
      "diagnostics": [],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_035_01_b:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_035_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "例えばですが……S.E.Mの楽曲に出てくる\n数学用語の解説をするのはどうでしょう？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "presence": "not-applicable",
        "reason": "non-idol-dialogue",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 9
      },
      "diagnostics": [],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_035_01_b:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_035_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "なるほど。全く馴染みのない用語の解説よりも、\n歌詞の解説のほうが興味を惹けるな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "硲 道夫"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "035mco"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "035mco",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 10
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_035_01_b:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_035_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "つまり、『自主的に知りたい』という感情から\n動画を見ることになる。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "硲 道夫"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "035mco"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "035mco",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 11
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
